<title>USA: U.S. lead stocks down in April - ABMS.</title>
<headline>U.S. lead stocks down in April - ABMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lead stocks held by U.S. refiners fell to 21,913 short tons at the end of April from 23,548 short tons at the end of March, said American Bureau of Metal Statistics.</p>
<p>Production of lead fell to 33,547 short tons in the month from 35,113 short tons in March.</p>
<p>Shipments from plants rose to 35,183 short tons in April compared with 24,674 short tons in the previous month.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
